[center][size=5][b]Bigger Item Grids and Smaller Inventory Slots[/b][/size]
Inventory increases from 5 rows to [b]7 rows[/b], technology from 3 to [b]4 rows[/b], and the
Transfer/Craft popups from 8 items to [b]24 slots[/b] per page - plus optional intro
logo and mod-warning skips[/center]
[b]What it does[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Inventory: [/b]Increase visible rows from 5 to [b]7[/b], Technology from 3 to [b]4[/b].[/*]
[*][b]Transfer Items and Craft Product popups: [/b]Increase from 4 by 2 (8 items per page) to [b]8 by 3 (24 cards per page)[/b][/*]
[*][b]Boot: [/b]Intro logos and mod-warning are skipped[/*]
[/list]

[b]Disabled intro skip or mod warning:[/b]

Edit the included [b]nms-tweaks.toml[/b] in the mod folder under [b]GAMEDATA/MODS[/b]. `inventory_grid` and `popup_pages` must be `true` for the bigger inventory to function.

[b]Install[/b]

Import the zip as a [b]Root Folder[/b] mod (Amethyst) or drop its contents
into the game folder.



[b]Compatibility[/b]
[list]
[*]Modifies the popup, inventory page, slot and box UI files, plus
pattern-scanned hooks for the grid, page size, intro skip and warning skip.
Nothing else[/*]
[*]Built for Cosmos v7.04 - a game update can shift the patterns, and the log
will say so instead of misbehaving[/*]
[*][b].lua [/b]included so you can merge with AMUMSS[/*]
[/list]
Built natively on Linux with my [url=https://github.com/SavageCore/AMUMSS/tree/feat/linux-support]AMUMSS Linux port[/url].

Source: [url=https://github.com/SavageCore/bigger-item-grids-and-smaller-inventory-slots]https://github.com/SavageCore/bigger-item-grids-and-smaller-inventory-slots[/url]